{"term":{"label":"德","occurrences":4,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"2B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii","title":"公孫丑下","description":"孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"利","id":"利"},{"form":"地","id":"地"},{"form":"大","id":"大"},{"form":"天","id":"天"},{"form":"德","id":"德"},{"form":"或","id":"或"},{"form":"敬","id":"敬"},{"form":"時","id":"時"},{"form":"朝","id":"朝"},{"form":"民","id":"民"},{"form":"莫","id":"莫"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"齊","id":"齊"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.7937907063396328,"source":"齊","target":"敬"},{"weight":1.0169342576538425,"source":"齊","target":"莫"},{"weight":0.2060040414375138,"source":"齊","target":"下"},{"weight":0.7937907063396328,"source":"齊","target":"地"},{"weight":1.0169342576538425,"source":"齊","target":"德"},{"weight":0.7937907063396328,"source":"齊","target":"民"},{"weight":3.403860499081639,"source":"利","target":"地"},{"weight":2.017566137961748,"source":"利","target":"天"},{"weight":2.7107133185216936,"source":"利","target":"時"},{"weight":1.4297794730596296,"source":"利","target":"下"},{"weight":2.2407096892759584,"source":"莫","target":"大"},{"weight":2.9338568698359038,"source":"莫","target":"敬"},{"weight":2.463853240590168,"source":"莫","target":"朝"},{"weight":2.463853240590168,"source":"莫","target":"德"},{"weight":2.2407096892759584,"source":"莫","target":"民"},{"weight":2.2407096892759584,"source":"民","target":"德"},{"weight":1.4297794730596296,"source":"民","target":"下"},{"weight":0.9189538492936389,"source":"民","target":"天"},{"weight":2.017566137961748,"source":"敬","target":"大"},{"weight":2.528391761727739,"source":"下","target":"天"},{"weight":0.5543107357057295,"source":"下","target":"今"},{"weight":1.4297794730596296,"source":"下","target":"地"},{"weight":1.6529230243738393,"s